&quot;Sine I have joined AMARIS in May 2016 and when the employee was added in AMARIS PF portal along with EPF Scheme the employee will be automatically enrolled in EPS Scheme as well.And once the employee is enrolled, there is no option in Employer PF Portal to change the option and hence the EPS contribution has made in case of Pavan. Without EPS contribution, the ECR File would not been validated for filing of monthly PF Returns&quot;


Please help me to transfer PF to Current employer.
